## Output
Return a single raw JSON object. No markdown, no code fences. Must start with `{` and end with `}`.

{% raw %}
{
  "reason": "Short explanation of the relationship decision (1-2 sentences).",
  "allow": boolean, true if both actors accept this status change, false if refused
}
{% endraw %}

[end system]

